 [:db/cas 17592186364178 :question/worked-solution "Let's rewrite the vectors ${a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}$ as a linear combination of the vectors ${q}_{1},{q}_{2},{q}_{3}:$\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{q}_{1} &=\\frac{1}{6}{a}_{1} \\\\ {q}_{2} &=\\frac{1}{2}{a}_{2}+8{q}_{1} \\\\ {q}_{3} &=\\frac{1}{3}{a}_{3}-3{q}_{1}+2{q}_{2}\\end{aligned}\\right.\\,⟹\\,\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1} &=6{q}_{1} \\\\ {a}_{2} &=-16{q}_{1}+2{q}_{2} \\\\ {a}_{3} &=9{q}_{1}-6{q}_{2}+3{q}_{3}.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nTherefore, this system can be written in matrix form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\overset{A}{\\overset{⏞}{\\begin{bmatrix}| & | & | \\\\ {a}_{1} & {a}_{2} & {a}_{3} \\\\ | & | & |\\end{bmatrix}}}=\\overset{Q}{\\overset{⏞}{\\begin{bmatrix}| & | & | \\\\ {q}_{1} & {q}_{2} & {q}_{3} \\\\ | & | & |\\end{bmatrix}}}\\overset{R}{\\overset{⏞}{\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -16 & 9 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.}}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n{r}_{13}+{r}_{22}+{r}_{33}=9+2+3=14.\n$$" "Let's rewrite the vectors ${a}_{1},{a}_{2},{a}_{3}$ as a linear combination of the vectors ${q}_{1},{q}_{2},{q}_{3}:$\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{q}_{1} &=\\frac{1}{6}{a}_{1} \\\\ {q}_{2} &=\\frac{1}{2}{a}_{2}+8{q}_{1} \\\\ {q}_{3} &=\\frac{1}{3}{a}_{3}-3{q}_{1}+2{q}_{2}\\end{aligned}\\right.\\,⟹\\,\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1} &=6{q}_{1} \\\\ {a}_{2} &=-16{q}_{1}+2{q}_{2} \\\\ {a}_{3} &=9{q}_{1}-6{q}_{2}+3{q}_{3}.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nTherefore, this system can be written in matrix form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\overbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}| & | & | \\\\ {a}_{1} & {a}_{2} & {a}_{3} \\\\ | & | & |\\end{bmatrix}}^{A}=\\overbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}| & | & | \\\\ {q}_{1} & {q}_{2} & {q}_{3} \\\\ | & | & |\\end{bmatrix}}^{Q}\\overbrace{\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -16 & 9 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.}^{R}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n{r}_{13}+{r}_{22}+{r}_{33}=9+2+3=14.\n$$"]
